{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"The large trunk of Cael’fii shudders as the very air seems to ache. A nervous but still smiling bloodhound shifter some of you have come to know as Sutri can be seen walking out from behind the tree. They shoot a nervous glance to their companion, a large glowing white stag who trails orange light. At once, you all hear in your heads: ||I assume that you are all here because you got the message about the risk the burrough’s parks are in. If you are not, I highly recommend you leave. This endeavor will be risky and not easy in any manner.|| ( <@&851451106226601995> react to this message with 🦌 if you will be participating)","created_at":"2021-07-21T02:03:26.540000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867225227662721024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"( i believe this is everyone who'll be doing the event, but feel free to join later, so long as you smack a deep on there to make prize math easier for me)","created_at":"2021-07-21T02:10:50.231000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867227088637001779","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Sutri nods, and looks to all of you. “Though we do not yet now the exact cause or mechanism, something is affecting the leylines, and that is very bad for ferrytown, its parks especially. We likely will not be able to wholly fix the issue, but hopefully we’ll be able to do enough that when the larger issue is fixed things can go back to normal relatively soon. We’ll need to have people here, at <#852741576237121561> , at <#852739507647545364> , and at <#852737863170654259>  Any questions?”\n(react with 🎪 for isle-o-fey, 🕸️ for the mounds, 🦝 for the hilltops, and 🌳 for jameco)","created_at":"2021-07-21T02:10:52.344000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T02:13:43.073000Z","id":"867227097499172874","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
